# namcap rule names, one per line (run-namcap.sh joins them into one -e RULELIST).
# Upstream ships a complete runtime inside the payload
# (resources/runtime/primary-runtime): CPython with its site-packages, plus
# native extensions and helper binaries built on the upstream build host.
#
#   pydepends  The Python modules those .py files import (charset-normalizer,
#              attrs, markupsafe, yaml) live inside the payload. namcap only
#              consults system packages, so they look missing. Vendoring a
#              system copy would change what the application loads.
#   rpath      The shipped ELF files keep the upstream build-host RPATH
#              (/tools/deps/lib). Rewriting it means patching upstream
#              artifacts this package deliberately does not touch.
#   runpath    Same artifacts carry the upstream build tree in RUNPATH.
pydepends
rpath
runpath
